{
	"name": "Elemental Expert",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/lightning/bolt-strike-explosion-blue.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Your study and dedication has borne real fruit, and you enjoy real points of distinction from elementalists with less intense focus. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>Your Dexterity, Constitution, or elementalist spellcasting ability score increases by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p></li><li><p>You gain an expertise die to your Arcana skill. Your maximum expertise die size for Arcana increases to a d10.</p></li><li><p>You learn an additional @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.puwxym4jiehmq3ud]{Elemental Adaptation}.</p></li><li><p>Your critical range for attacks made with your @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.uit7l3mc64l5h8h1]{Elemental Blast} increases by 1, to a maximum range of 17-20.</p></li><li><p>When you score a critical with your elemental blast, you can choose to allow energy overflow to happen on either end of the blast. Creatures within 5 feet of either you or the target (choose each time you score a critical hit; you can also choose not to use this benefit) must make a Dexterity save against your spell save DC or suffer 1d12 points of damage of a type your elemental blast dealt.</p></li></ul>",
